      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "De una mitad hicieron la tierra. La otra mitad la subieron, y se convirtió en el cielo.",
          "en": "From one half they made the earth. The other half they lifted up, and it became the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los otros dioses se enojaron mucho. Les pareció injusto lo que le habían hecho.",
          "en": "The other gods were very upset. What had been done to her seemed unfair."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que bajaron a consolarla. Y decidieron que de ella saldría todo lo que la gente necesita para vivir.",
          "en": "So they came down to comfort her. They decided that everything people need to live would come from her."
        }
      ],
