      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "De su pelo nacieron los árboles, las flores y las hierbas.",
          "en": "From her hair grew trees, flowers and herbs."
        },
        {
          "es": "De su piel, el pasto y las florecitas. De sus ojos, los pozos y los manantiales.",
          "en": "From her skin came grass and little flowers. From her eyes came wells and springs."
        },
        {
          "es": "De su boca, los ríos y las cuevas grandes. De su nariz, los valles. De sus hombros, las montañas.",
          "en": "From her mouth came rivers and great caves. From her nose, valleys. From her shoulders, mountains."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso, decían, todo lo que comemos sale de la tierra.",
          "en": "That is why, they said, everything we eat comes out of the earth."
        }
      ],
